Blackboard Text
===============

This is a substantially modified fork of Blackboard by James Wolensky (MIT):
https://github.com/jameswolensky/obsidian-blackboard
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original author.

Original work: Copyright (c) 2026 James Wolensky.
Fork changes: Copyright (c) 2026 Tatyana (Blackboard Text fork).
The plugin's MIT license and both copyright notices are retained in LICENSE.

The fork uses plugin ID blackboard-text. The original uses blackboard.
Both register blackboard-view and the .blackboard extension; do not enable
both plugins together in the same vault.

